# Multi-LLM Debate Arena Rules

## Tech Stack
- Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- Tailwind CSS
- Prisma (SQLite)
- LLM APIs (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, etc.)

## Project Structure
- `app/`: Next.js pages and API routes.
- `components/`: React components.
- `lib/`: Business logic, types, and utility functions.
- `prisma/`: Database schema and migrations.
- `scripts/`: Maintenance and evaluation scripts.

## Coding Standards
- Use TypeScript for all new code.
- Follow Shadcn UI patterns for components.
- Keep business logic in `lib/` and out of components where possible.
- Use environment variables for all API keys and secrets.
